        "text": "Coinbase Transaction (Block 840000 — 4th Halving)\n\nSection A (top): Block height feeds into:\n  • coinbase_script_height → BIP34 height push bytes (0340d10c)\n  • block_subsidy_satoshis → 312500000 sats (3.125 BTC)\n  • satoshi_to_8_le → 8-byte little-endian value field\n\nSection B: concat_all assembles the raw coinbase TX:\n  version(4) | inputCount(1) | prevHash(32) | prevIdx(4)\n  | scriptSigLen(1) | scriptSig(5) | sequence(4)\n  | outputCount(1) | value(8) | scriptPubKey(26) | locktime(4)\n\nSection C: double SHA-256 → reverse bytes → Coinbase TXID",
